# Proximity cloak SPEL / MGEF — retired

The Glowing One–cloned proximity cloak chain (FormIDs `0x870`–`0x873`) and
`PickmansWhisperProximityEffect.psc` were **removed** with user approval.

## Do not reintroduce without explicit permission

- Ability/Hit/Cloak SPEL or MGEF at `0x01000870`–`0x01000873`
- `PickmansWhisperProximityEffect` / `PickmansCloakSpell` / `GrantProximityCloak`
- Builder `build_proximity_*` helpers or VMAD binds for those records

## Allowed

- Other SPEL/MGEF (Knife Hunger, future magic) unrelated to that retired chain
